msgid "Exclusions de WP Rocket descartades"
msgstr "Discarded WP Rocket exclusions"

#: includes/class-wmrb-admin-page.php:256
msgid ""
"Aquests patrons no són expressions regulars usables i s’han deixat fora del "
"snippet. Incloure’ls faria que Apache rebutgés la directiva o que "
"s’exclogués tot el trànsit. Corregeix-los a WP Rocket:"
msgstr ""
"These patterns are not usable regular expressions and were left out of the "
"snippet. Including them would make Apache reject the directive or exclude "
"all traffic. Fix them in WP Rocket:"

