#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:143
msgid "Encara no hi ha cap bloc MaxCache."
msgstr "There is no MaxCache block yet."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:152
msgid ".htaccess no és llegible; no es pot determinar qui governa MaxCache."
msgstr ".htaccess is not readable; cannot determine who governs MaxCache."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:167
msgid ""
"Hi ha més d’un bloc MaxCache actiu o el bloc WMRB conviu amb un altre bloc "
"extern."
msgstr ""
"There is more than one active MaxCache block, or the WMRB block coexists "
"with another external block."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:176
msgid "El bridge governa l’únic bloc MaxCache actiu."
msgstr "The bridge governs the only active MaxCache block."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:185
msgid ""
"S’ha detectat un bloc MaxCache extern/manual; el bridge no és el propietari "
"actual."
msgstr ""
"An external/manual MaxCache block was detected; the bridge is not the "
"current owner."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:193
msgid "No hi ha cap bloc MaxCache gestionat pel bridge."
msgstr "There is no MaxCache block managed by the bridge."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:347
msgid ".htaccess no accessible (read/write)."
msgstr ".htaccess not accessible (read/write)."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:353
msgid ""
"El directori arrel no és escrivible: no es pot escriure .htaccess de forma "
"atòmica i el bridge no farà una escriptura insegura."
msgstr ""
"The document root is not writable: .htaccess cannot be written atomically, "
"and the bridge will not perform an unsafe write."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:358
#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:600
msgid ""
"Ja hi ha una operació del bridge en curs; torna-ho a provar en uns segons."
msgstr ""
"Another bridge operation is already in progress; try again in a few seconds."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:370
msgid ""
"No s’ha pogut analitzar .htaccess amb prou seguretat: hi ha una secció "
"<IfModule> sense tancar o sintaxi ambigua. Corregeix-la manualment abans de "
"fer el takeover."
msgstr ""
".htaccess could not be parsed safely enough: an <IfModule> section is "
"unclosed or the syntax is ambiguous. Fix it manually before taking over."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:383
msgid "No s’ha pogut crear backup de .htaccess."
msgstr "Could not create .htaccess backup."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:395
msgid ""
".htaccess ha canviat mentre s’aplicava el snippet; no s’ha escrit res. Torna-"
"ho a provar."
msgstr ""
".htaccess changed while the snippet was being applied; nothing was written. "
"Try again."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:399
msgid "No s’ha pogut escriure .htaccess de forma atòmica i segura."
msgstr "Could not write .htaccess atomically and safely."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:458
msgid ""
"Snippet aplicat, però la sonda prèvia no ha establert una referència fiable. "
"Comprova manualment que el web respon."
msgstr ""
"Snippet applied, but the pre-write probe did not establish a reliable "
"baseline. Check manually that the site responds."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:469
msgid ""
"El web respon, però .htaccess ha canviat després de l’escriptura del bridge; "
"el snippet ja no es pot considerar aplicat. Torna-ho a provar."
msgstr ""
"The site responds, but .htaccess changed after the bridge wrote it; the "
"snippet can no longer be considered applied. Try again."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:482
msgid ""
"Snippet aplicat, però no s’ha pogut verificar que el web respon. Comprova-ho "
"manualment."
msgstr ""
"Snippet applied, but the site response could not be verified. Check it "
"manually."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:493
msgid ""
"El web no respon, però .htaccess ha canviat després de l’escriptura del "
"bridge; no s’ha fet cap rollback automàtic. Revisa-ho manualment."
msgstr ""
"The site does not respond, but .htaccess changed after the bridge wrote it; "
"no automatic rollback was performed. Review it manually."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:500
msgid ""
"El web ha deixat de respondre després d’aplicar el snippet; s’ha "
"restaurat .htaccess automàticament."
msgstr ""
"The site stopped responding after the snippet was applied; .htaccess was "
"restored automatically."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:506
msgid ""
"CRÍTIC: el web no respon i no s’ha pogut restaurar .htaccess. Restaura el "
"backup manualment."
msgstr ""
"CRITICAL: the site does not respond and .htaccess could not be restored. "
"Restore the backup manually."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:590
msgid "No hi ha backup vàlid per rollback."
msgstr "No valid backup available for rollback."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:609
msgid "Rollback fallit: no es pot escriure .htaccess de forma atòmica."
msgstr "Rollback failed: .htaccess cannot be written atomically."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:897
msgid ""
"Hi ha un bloc MaxCache extern; el bridge no auto-aplica fins que es passi a "
"mode gestionat."
msgstr ""
"There is an external MaxCache block; the bridge will not auto-apply until "
"the site is moved to managed mode."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:901
msgid "Hi ha conflicte entre blocs MaxCache; resol-lo abans d’auto-aplicar."
msgstr ""
"There is a conflict between MaxCache blocks; resolve it before auto-apply."

#: includes/class-wmrb-sync-manager.php:905
msgid ".htaccess no és llegible; no es pot validar el mode gestionat."
msgstr ".htaccess is not readable; managed mode cannot be validated."

